---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="ECONOZONE — Carrières &amp; Opportunités">
  <div class="lang-switch-inline">
    <button class="active" data-set-lang="fr">FR</button>
    <button data-set-lang="en">EN</button>
  </div>


    <div data-lang="fr">
      <div class="breadcrumb">ECONOZONE &rsaquo; Carrières &amp; Opportunités</div>
      <h1>Carrières &amp; Opportunités en Afrique de l'Ouest</h1>
      <p class="dek">ECONOZONE n'héberge pas directement d'offres d'emploi. Cette page recense les vraies plateformes spécialisées, pays par pays et à l'échelle régionale, pour vous éviter de les chercher une par une.</p>

      <h2>Par pays (UEMOA)</h2>
      <div class="country-grid">
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇨🇮 Côte d'Ivoire</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploi.ci" target="_blank">Emploi.ci &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://offre-emploi.ci" target="_blank">Offre-emploi.ci &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://projobivoire.com" target="_blank">Projobivoire &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇸🇳 Sénégal</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploidakar.com" target="_blank">EmploiDakar &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://senjob.com" target="_blank">Senjob &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://expat-dakar.com" target="_blank">Expat-Dakar (Emploi) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇧🇫 Burkina Faso</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploiburkina.com" target="_blank">Emploiburkina &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://emploi.lefaso.net" target="_blank">Emploi.lefaso.net &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇲🇱 Mali</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://anpe-mali.org" target="_blank">ANPE Mali (officiel) &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://malibaara.com" target="_blank">Malibaara &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇳🇪 Niger</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://nigeremploi.com" target="_blank">NigerEmploi &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://nigerjob.net" target="_blank">NigerJob &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇧🇯 Bénin</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploibenin.com" target="_blank">EmploiBenin &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://anpe-bj.org" target="_blank">ANPE Bénin (officiel) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇹🇬 Togo</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://lucreatif.com" target="_blank">Lucreatif &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://anpetogo.org" target="_blank">ANPE Togo (officiel) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇬🇼 Guinée-Bissau</h3><ul>
          <li style="font-size:12px; color:var(--label);">Aucune plateforme dédiée fiable identifiée à ce stade.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <h2>À l'échelle régionale (CEDEAO élargie)</h2>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Senjob</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Couvre 8 pays d'un coup : Sénégal, Côte d'Ivoire, Burkina Faso, Mali, Niger, Guinée, Togo, Bénin — le plus proche d'un vrai agrégateur régional francophone.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://senjob.com" target="_blank">senjob.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>AfricaWork</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">37 pays africains, 3,8 millions de candidats enregistrés — plutôt orienté cadres et profils seniors, cabinet de recrutement avec plateforme digitale.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.africawork.com" target="_blank">africawork.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Njorku</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Agrège les offres de multiples sources (web, presse, mobile) dans 15+ pays africains — un vrai moteur de recherche d'offres, pas une plateforme de dépôt de CV.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.njorku.com" target="_blank">njorku.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Pour les postes internationaux, ONG et institutions basés en zone UEMOA</h2>
      <p>Pertinent pour les postes en évaluation, développement, ONU et coopération internationale — le type de poste qui échappe souvent aux plateformes commerciales ci-dessus.</p>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>ReliefWeb (Jobs)</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Le tableau d'offres de référence pour le secteur humanitaire et le développement international, filtrable par pays d'Afrique de l'Ouest.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://reliefweb.int/jobs" target="_blank">reliefweb.int/jobs &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Devex</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Offres spécialisées coopération internationale et développement, avec de nombreux postes basés en Afrique de l'Ouest.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.devex.com/jobs" target="_blank">devex.com/jobs &#8599;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer">ECONOZONE ne publie ni ne vérifie directement ces offres d'emploi — cette page est un annuaire de plateformes tierces, mis à jour périodiquement. Vérifiez toujours la légitimité d'une offre avant de transmettre des documents personnels.</div>
    </div>

    <div data-lang="en">
      <div class="breadcrumb">ECONOZONE &rsaquo; Careers &amp; Opportunities</div>
      <h1>Careers &amp; Opportunities in West Africa</h1>
      <p class="dek">ECONOZONE does not host job listings directly. This page curates real, specialized platforms, country by country and region-wide, so you don't have to search for them one by one.</p>

      <h2>By country (WAEMU)</h2>
      <div class="country-grid">
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇨🇮 Côte d'Ivoire</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploi.ci" target="_blank">Emploi.ci &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://offre-emploi.ci" target="_blank">Offre-emploi.ci &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://projobivoire.com" target="_blank">Projobivoire &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇸🇳 Senegal</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploidakar.com" target="_blank">EmploiDakar &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://senjob.com" target="_blank">Senjob &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://expat-dakar.com" target="_blank">Expat-Dakar (Jobs) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇧🇫 Burkina Faso</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploiburkina.com" target="_blank">Emploiburkina &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://emploi.lefaso.net" target="_blank">Emploi.lefaso.net &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇲🇱 Mali</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://anpe-mali.org" target="_blank">ANPE Mali (official) &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://malibaara.com" target="_blank">Malibaara &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇳🇪 Niger</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://nigeremploi.com" target="_blank">NigerEmploi &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://nigerjob.net" target="_blank">NigerJob &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇧🇯 Benin</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://emploibenin.com" target="_blank">EmploiBenin &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://anpe-bj.org" target="_blank">ANPE Benin (official) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇹🇬 Togo</h3><ul>
          <li><a href="https://lucreatif.com" target="_blank">Lucreatif &#8599;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://anpetogo.org" target="_blank">ANPE Togo (official) &#8599;</a></li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="country-card"><h3>🇬🇼 Guinea-Bissau</h3><ul>
          <li style="font-size:12px; color:var(--label);">No reliable dedicated platform identified yet.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <h2>Region-wide (broader ECOWAS)</h2>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Senjob</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Covers 8 countries at once: Senegal, Côte d'Ivoire, Burkina Faso, Mali, Niger, Guinea, Togo, Benin — the closest thing to a real regional francophone aggregator.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://senjob.com" target="_blank">senjob.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>AfricaWork</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">37 African countries, 3.8 million registered candidates — leans toward executive and senior profiles, a recruitment firm with a digital platform.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.africawork.com" target="_blank">africawork.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Njorku</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Aggregates listings from multiple sources (web, press, mobile) across 15+ African countries — a real search engine for job listings, not a resume-drop platform.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.njorku.com" target="_blank">njorku.com &#8599;</a>
      </div>

      <h2>For international, NGO and institutional roles based in WAEMU</h2>
      <p>Relevant for evaluation, development, UN and international cooperation roles — the kind of position that often slips through the commercial platforms above.</p>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>ReliefWeb (Jobs)</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">The reference job board for the humanitarian and international development sector, filterable by West African country.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://reliefweb.int/jobs" target="_blank">reliefweb.int/jobs &#8599;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-card">
        <h3>Devex</h3>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 8px;">Specialized listings for international cooperation and development, with many roles based in West Africa.</p>
        <a class="site-link" href="https://www.devex.com/jobs" target="_blank">devex.com/jobs &#8599;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer">ECONOZONE does not publish or verify these listings directly — this page is a directory of third-party platforms, updated periodically. Always verify a listing's legitimacy before sending personal documents.</div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
:root {
    --bg: #FFFFFF; --panel: #FFFFFF; --panel-alt: #F4F7FB; --border: #D9E0EA; --row-border: #EEF2F7;
    --blue: #003DA5; --blue-dark: #00286E; --green: #00843D; --navy: #003DA5; --text: #10182B; --text-muted: #3D4759; --label: #64708A;
    --accent: #00843D; --up: #00843D; --down: #C0392B;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .wrap { width: 100%; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .topbar { width: 100%; background: var(--navy); }
  .topbar-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .brand { color: #fff; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .lang-switch { display: flex; gap: 2px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px; }
  .lang-switch button { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans'; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 5px 12px; border: none; background: transparent; color: #B9C4D6; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
  .lang-switch button.active { background: #fff; color: var(--navy); }
  .col { width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }
  .breadcrumb { font-size: 12px; color: var(--label); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  h1 { font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); margin: 0 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .dek { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 720px; margin: 0 0 28px; line-height: 1.6; }
  h2 { font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); margin: 40px 0 8px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 720px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .country-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .country-card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 16px 18px; }
  .country-card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .country-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .country-card a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .country-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .agg-card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 18px 20px; margin: 12px 0; }
  .agg-card h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--navy); }
  .agg-card a.site-link { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
  .disclaimer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 11px; color: var(--label); }
  [data-lang="en"] { display: none; }
  .lang-switch-inline { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .lang-switch-inline button { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans'; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #fff; color: var(--text-muted); border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }
  .lang-switch-inline button.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
</style>

<script>
document.querySelectorAll('[data-set-lang]').forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var lang = btn.getAttribute('data-set-lang');
      document.querySelectorAll('.lang-switch button').forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-lang]').forEach(function (block) {
        block.style.display = (block.getAttribute('data-lang') === lang) ? '' : 'none';
      });
    });
  });
</script>
